HakiOS

This repository is the device layer of HakiOS for one phone: the Xiaomi Mi A2 (jasmine_sprout, Qualcomm SDM660).
It holds the phone's configuration, the SoC's facts, the phone's own device tree and the notes of the port.

The kernel itself is not here: it is in the common repository, oosexgang/hakios-xnu-kernel, whose patch and drivers
are a derivative work of Apple's XNU and are licensed under the Apple Public Source License, Version 2.0. Everything
that is ours here -- the configuration, the scripts, the tools and the documentation -- is licensed under the MIT
License below.

Nothing of the vendor's is here: the phone's own firmware comes off your own phone (pull-firmware.sh) and is never
committed, and the device tree in prebuilt/ is derived from the phone's own vendor kernel, which is the work of
Qualcomm and of Xiaomi.

